    {
      "id": "claim_54f564fecf674a8f808126cc091cdc4b",
      "statement": "action-cli's AWS action handling reads its region/operation allowlist from the same environment variables the server reads (ROSA_TA_AWS_ALLOWED_REGIONS, ROSA_TA_AWS_ALLOWED_OPERATIONS) rather than exposing CLI-only allowlist flags, so the CLI cannot exercise more than the server would permit, and denies all AWS actions if the region allowlist is unset.",
