      "statement": "rta's HTTP client (internal/rta.NewClient) refuses to send a configured bearer token over plain HTTP to a non-loopback host, and its redirect checker rejects any redirect that would downgrade an HTTPS request to a non-HTTPS URL, capping redirect chains at 10 hops.",
